      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 10 — Content Pipeline\nSPECIALIST AGENT execution, one execution per task.\n\n**Agents:** Website Copywriter, Brand Voice, Conversion Optimization (review gate), Proposal Agent, Project Documentation, Revision Manager.\n\nStart → pre-execution tools (real audits) → Model Router → Context Builder (only what this task needs) → Key Manager / 55 RPM limiter → NVIDIA call → structured-output review (schema, files, sub-agents, review gates) → next stage. Failures go to the Error / Retry Manager.",
